## Motivation

@humansand

**Scope: DeepSeek V4 FlashInfer top-k backend support.** This PR makes `--dsa-topk-backend flashinfer` usable for the DeepSeek V4 indexer. It uses FlashInfer's fused compact-page transform when `SGLANG_DSA_FUSE_TOPK=true` and preserves the existing unfused FlashInfer path
